{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-15","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正六边形的尺规作图","englishTitle":"In a given circle to inscribe an equilateral and equiangular hexagon.","book":4,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","contentId":"euclid-4-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d22e79be20e30b5afab81b37db155c292655b960a98e45e8474ea387dc28215","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-15.statement","euclid-4-15.construction.1","euclid-4-15.construction.2","euclid-4-15.proof.1","euclid-4-15.proof.2","euclid-4-15.proof.3","euclid-4-15.proof.4","euclid-4-15.proof.5","euclid-4-15.proof.6","euclid-4-15.proof.7","euclid-4-15.proof.8","euclid-4-15.proof.9","euclid-4-15.proof.10","euclid-4-15.proof.11","euclid-4-15.proof.12","euclid-4-15.proof.13","euclid-4-15.proof.14","euclid-4-15.proof.15","euclid-4-15.proof.16","euclid-4-15.proof.17","euclid-4-15.proof.18","euclid-4-15.conclusion","euclid-4-15.historical.1","euclid-4-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35046d5261d1116673185a6fa1cf0bb56e7a95c09b47529d35d098f0b20fc185","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a given circle to inscribe an equilateral and equiangular hexagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的圆中输入等边和等角六边形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作圜内六边切形其形等边等角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个圆，找到圆内六边形的切线，其形状是等边且等角的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"862501db7db3e9f934faa30d9cd3849f46317d9032b3152f54760010c65946e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCDEF be the given circle; thus it is required to inscribe an equilateral and equiangular hexagon in the circle ABCDEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCDEF 成为给定的圆; 因此, 必须在 ABCDEF 圆中加入一个等边和等角六边形 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e3b6cc78fbabdb55e4479a867151f15489ae0cbc46accc19f4634d39de3e116","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the diameter AD of the circle ABCDEF be drawn; let the centre G of the circle be taken, and with centre D and distance DG let the circle EGCH be described; let EG, CG be joined and carried through to the points B, F, and let AB, BC, CD, DE, EF, FA be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘制ABCDEF圆的直径AD;将圆的中心G,以D和DG中点为中心,将EGCH圆加以说明;将EG、CG圆连接起来,并穿过B、F点,将AB、BC、CD、DE、EF、FA点连接起来。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"688d56e134c8d6236d04f1572ace5c3915843f986a70169d6d9e479ee2c30307","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the hexagon ABCDEF is equilateral and equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说六角ABCDEF是等边和等角的"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb05498d0baa9fc187594131993139d08b8111e60177fdcb72eff2b3b081c187","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the point G is the centre of the circle ABCDEF, GE is equal to GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于点G是ABCDEF圆的中央,GE等于GD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d428415f2e9c4678c1a40cb8c54a6b8a107ea268af4807844274f9c69a237cf9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point D is the centre of the circle GCH, DE is equal to DG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于D点是GCH点的中心,DE点等于DG点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6057521d6dc4a85b8e52241e6c473e9b2855a0c39e068253c7f7c3c1c89f864","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GE was proved equal to GD; therefore GE is also equal to ED; therefore the triangle EGD is equilateral; and therefore its three angles EGD, GDE, DEG are equal to one another, inasmuch as, in isosceles triangles, the angles at the base are equal to one another. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GE被证明等于GD,因此GE也等于ED;因此,三角形EGD是等式的;因此,三角形EGD,GDE,DEG,彼此等同,因为等腰三角形,底边,角度彼此等同。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84e6d124d7998b6d86b239d11752e4d95cffcb177f0ebab1f9f35ecb010bc909","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the three angles of the triangle are equal to two right angles; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the angle EGD is one-third of two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形的三个角度等于两个直角, 所以角度EGD是两个直角的三分之一。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2049714adf8510c2eae229a7ec7e79e7e21ded00aa626992af63bb6c425bbaa7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly, the angle DGC can also be proved to be onethird of two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,DGC角度也可以证明是2 直角角度的三分之一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f1f83a93685045cbc8a5fc1e5d1fd092a190906408a0dbd6ab077f5e65d9748","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line CG standing on EB makes the adjacent angles EGC, CGB equal to two right angles, therefore the remaining angle CGB is also one-third of two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EB线上的CG直线 使相邻角为EGC,CGB等于2,直角, 其余的CGB也是2,直角的三分之一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bdad758345f1ae308e9bd1c888a69a55df6c0eced5e13be515bad1d5c24d790","citations":["euclid-1-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angles EGD, DGC, CGB are equal to one another; so that the angles vertical to them, the angles BGA, AGF, FGE are equal. [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EGD、DGC、CGB等角度是等同的;因此,垂直角度是BGA、AGF、FGE等。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9ee714d687c0b76acb5cdcb8872d610ee1c4db280353f81415ce22feac35c3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the six angles EGD, DGC, CGB, BGA, AGF, FGE are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,6个角度,即EGD、DGC、CGB、BGA、AGF、FGE等,是彼此相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8be39ab60f416eea50552a297e3ef1685ba6bb748d3e5788f3c2759e4c717e5","citations":["euclid-3-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equal angles stand on equal circumferences; [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)] therefore the six circumferences AB, BC, CD, DE, EF, FA are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角对等的环形是相同的;因此,六条环形是AB、BC、CD、DE、EF、FA等。 [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"536c387309659c7b3ffd7635945fd6eaffa71adcb1702d435dc83705c710998a","citations":["euclid-3-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And equal circumferences are subtended by equal straight lines; [[III. 29](/principles/euclid-3-29)] therefore the six straight lines are equal to one another; therefore the hexagon ABCDEF is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等宽线由等直线组成,因此六条直线是等直线;因此六边ABCDEF是等直线。 [[III. 29](/principles/euclid-3-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aff5930db734ec5c20ca44a9f9dc8e5a0d9500bfd5fb27e77abd4865b141557c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它也是角形的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bd615d414b6386bf95e6ce7635bfaa380c06abff65b2ab6c9a1a500ca5d5401","citations":["euclid-3-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the circumference FA is equal to the circumference ED, let the circumference ABCD be added to each; therefore the whole FABCD is equal to the whole EDCBA; and the angle FED stands on the circumference FABCD, and the angle AFE on the circumference EDCBA; therefore the angle AFE is equal to the angle DEF. [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为环形FA等于环形ED,所以每个环形ABCD;因此,整个FABCD等于整个EDCBA;而角FED则位于环形FABCD,角AFE等于角EDCBA;因此,角AFE等于角DEF。 [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be806faeb11f2351df6ecd486dec3cc5b4e2f7106add522bd370706751c44207","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that the remaining angles of the hexagon ABCDEF are also severally equal to each of the angles AFE, FED; therefore the hexagon ABCDEF is equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明六角ABCDEF的剩余角也与AFE、FED角的每一个角数相等;因此,六角ABCDEF是等角的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a2486cd0c52b08cbd35fee69b959c49cc8f28d7194f77458ab3d768e7237518","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved equilateral; and it has been inscribed in the circle ABCDEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也证明是等边的, 并且它被刻在了ABCDEF的圆圈里。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"210b359612fa743099f04b072261ba12537d7a9c9233094d4f032a3b4972a6b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the given circle an equilateral and equiangular hexagon has been inscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定圆内已刻有等边和等角六边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc7f092e48cad6f9063824d3377a2154587374b37d3cd8cf4e558e91aa75381c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that the side of the hexagon is equal to the radius of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱。 从这一点可以看出,六边形的侧面等于圆的半径。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7f06cd892acaf0ac10eb9be8783dfb72c4e5b478d7b84ce70075036c32f7011","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, in like manner as in the case of the pentagon, if through the points of division on the circle we draw tangents to the circle, there will be circumscribed about the circle an equilateral and equiangular hexagon in conformity with what was explained in the case of the pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"和五角形一样,如果通过圆上的分点,我们画出圆的正切点, 圆上就会有一条等边和等角的六边形, 与五角形的情况一致。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"969155a2ce4c25b5494fb4f146d79a3050214797d8d441dca1e2415cf4212ee3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And further by means similar to those explained in the case of the pentagon we can both inscribe a circle in a given hexagon and circumscribe one about it. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且通过类似于五角形的情况 来进一步,我们既可以在特定的六边形中 输入一个圆圈,又可以对它进行限定。 Q, E, F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":22,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08fd3d5f76cf8a9415fd9bdd573a668f14f8e6e503875222165c5587473072ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作圜内六边切形其形等边等角法曰甲乙丙丁戊己圜其心庚求作六边内切圜形等边等角先作甲丁径线次以丁为心庚为界作圜两圜相交于丙于戊次从庚心作丙庚戊庚两线各引长之为丙己戊乙末作甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊己己甲六线相聨即成甲乙丙丁戊己内切圜六边形而等边等角论曰庚丙庚丁两线等而丁丙与丁庚亦等〈依圜界说〉三边俱等即庚丙丁为平边角形而庚丁丙丁丙庚丙庚丁三角俱等〈一卷五〉此三角元与两直角等〈一卷卅二〉即每角为两直角三分之一而丙庚丁角为两直角三分之一也依显丁庚戊角亦两直角三分之一而丙庚丁丁庚戊戊庚己三角又等于两直角〈一卷十三〉即戊庚己角亦两直角三分之一矣则丙庚丁丁庚戊戊庚己三角亦自相等而此三角与己庚甲甲庚乙乙庚丙三角亦等〈一卷十五〉是辏庚心之六角俱自相等而所乘之六圜分〈三卷廿六〉及甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊己己甲六线俱自相等〈三卷廿九〉则甲乙丙丁戊己形之六边等乂乙丙与甲己两圜分等而各加一丙丁戊己圜分即乙丙丁戊己与甲己戊丁丙两圜分等而所乘之乙甲己与甲乙丙两角等〈三卷廿七〉依显乙丙丁丙丁戊丁戊己戊己甲四角与乙甲己甲乙丙两角俱等则甲乙丙丁戊己形之六角等一系凡圜之半径为六分圜之一之分弦何者庚丁与丁丙等故故一开规为圜不动而可六平分之二系依前十二十三十四题可作六边等边等角形在圜之外又六边等边等角形内可作切圜又六边等边等角形外可作切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有圆求作圆内六边切形其形等边等角作图方法如下：甲乙丙丁戊己圆其心庚求作六边内切圆形等边等角先作甲丁径线次以丁为心庚为界作圆两圆相交于丙于戊次从庚心作丙庚戊庚两线各引长之为丙己戊乙末作甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊己己甲六线相连接即成甲乙丙丁戊己内切圆六边形而等边等角证明如下：庚丙庚丁两线等而丁丙与丁庚亦等〈依圆周说〉三边都等即庚丙丁为等边三角形而庚丁丙丁丙庚丙庚丁三角都等〈一卷五〉此三角元与两直角等〈一卷卅二〉即每角为两直角三分之一而丙庚丁角为两直角三分之一也依显丁庚戊角亦两直角三分之一而丙庚丁丁庚戊戊庚己三角又等于两直角〈一卷十三〉即戊庚己角亦两直角三分之一矣则丙庚丁丁庚戊戊庚己三角亦自相等而此三角与己庚甲甲庚乙乙庚丙三角亦等〈一卷十五〉是辏庚心之六角都自相等而所乘之六圆弧〈三卷廿六〉及甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊己己甲六线都自相等〈三卷廿九〉则甲乙丙丁戊己形之六边等乂乙丙与甲己两圆弧等而各加一丙丁戊己圆弧即乙丙丁戊己与甲己戊丁丙两圆弧等而所乘之乙甲己与甲乙丙两角等〈三卷廿七〉依显乙丙丁丙丁戊丁戊己戊己甲四角与乙甲己甲乙丙两角都等则甲乙丙丁戊己形之六角等一系凡圆之半径为六分圆之一之分弦何者庚丁与丁丙等故故一开规为圆不动而可六平分之二系依前十二十三十四题可作六边等边等三角形在圆之外又六边等边等三角形内可作切圆又六边等边等三角形外可作切圆"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-15.source","contentId":"euclid-4-15","revisionId":"euclid-4-15@raw-8d22e79be20e30b5","order":23,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70858473be683b0ca5515828f35573350f667970f176097f10bca13c2812fe35","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-1-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-15.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"I. 5"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-15.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis"